SUMMARY:Deadline: Cork International Film Festival 2026: Call for Entries
DESCRIPTION:Cork International Film Festival\, Ireland's oldest film festiv
 al\, accepts fiction\, documentary\, animation\, and experimental work acr
 oss features and shorts\, with Academy Award and BAFTA qualifying shorts s
 trands. Late deadline for features\, feature documentaries\, international
  shorts\, and documentary shorts is 31 July 2026 (Irish shorts have until 
 7 August 2026). Most strands require an Irish premiere. Fee waivers availa
 ble on request.\n\nOrganisation: Cork International Film Festival\nLocatio
 n: Cork\, Ireland. Open to international entries\; most strands require an
  Irish premiere.\nAward: Screening at Ireland's oldest film festival (Nove
 mber 2026)\, including Academy Award and BAFTA qualifying shorts strands. 
 FilmFreeway submission fee applies\; fee waivers available by emailing inf
 o@corkfilmfest.org with the subject WAIVER REQUEST.\nDuration: Festival ru
 ns November 2026. Features completed after 1 December 2025\; shorts after 
